{"version":1,"content":"<p>數據分析機構Sensor Tower有一套銷量追蹤工具，可以隨時查看遊戲賣出了多少份。不過，能達到《GTA6》這種數字的遊戲肯定不多。該網站稱，Rockstar這款犯罪題材續作最近僅靠預購，收入就已經突破7.51億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585024.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:06:32.083397+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:57:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:54.365324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:54.365324+00:00","content_hash":"47736d5e17d0e43d8d0824d3ae3dee97638bbb241db0c8bff76fb011d7e437ea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}